rtw88 of Linux 6.18.63 on Linux 6.12: the kernel interfaces that changed in between (as for rtw89, ADR 0027).

- config, set_rts_threshold, set_antenna, get_antenna: without the radio index (added in 6.17)
- link_sta_rc_update (6.13) is sta_rc_update in 6.12, with the station instead of its link
- timer_container_of (6.16) is from_timer in 6.12

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

